<node id="Dashboard">
  <data key="d0">Dashboard</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">The Dashboard is a control panel or interface where users can manage their email marketing activities.&lt;SEP&gt;The dashboard is a central hub for managing and accessing various tools and features within a platform or system.&lt;SEP&gt;The dashboard is a user interface or control panel that provides access to various tools and features, including the Hotels tab.&lt;SEP&gt;The Dashboard is a tool where users can manage their site's settings, including pricing plans and coupons.&lt;SEP&gt;The dashboard is where users can access and manage their collection content.</data>
