<node id="Wix">
  <data key="d0">Wix</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Wix is a company that provides a comprehensive platform for creating and managing websites, offering a wide range of services and features to its users. The company's platform includes tools for building and managing websites, content management systems, and website hosting services, as well as domain registration. Wix enables users to create dynamic pages and manage collections, making it a versatile platform for various online needs.

In addition to website creation and hosting, Wix offers specialized services such as Wix Stores, a platform for creating and managing online stores, and Wix Bookings, a feature that enables users to manage bookings and appointments. The company also provides payment services, including Wix Payments, which allows for direct payment acceptance. Furthermore, Wix supports various alternative payment providers, including PayPal, giving users flexibility and convenience in managing their online transactions.

Wix prioritizes user experience, offering a customer care team for support and requiring account verification to ensure secure payment services. The platform also allows for domain connection via pointing, making it easy for users to establish an online presence. Overall, Wix is a one-stop solution for individuals and businesses looking to create, manage, and grow their online presence, providing a seamless and user-friendly experience for its customers. With its broad range of services and features, Wix caters to the diverse needs of its users, from website creation and hosting to online store management and payment processing.&lt;SEP&gt;Wix is a website creation platform that can be connected to Google Workspace.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7f49a209ebbbdf633aeb86649c74ccef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a35c395eb2de6194b0d0b819cc25645d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9eb2916332bbcbddbdea2dea8c35ce03&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b261bd1be516879bb4cf4c614f85d257&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b547442ea82aacb3fc7acd39a219545d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11fcbe4f87372db8aaaa4dc2b55ebe20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4d8052bab145fa732f5fa1156e51a44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f913ed06c16cdc1c835dc4e177c1fee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-134de6c869a1bdf0a400dfea307efdce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb89443093a62ed04b233cc893d59471&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2500f2053a8609c7241fe3edad39c0a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e3ee50229a1fd0f63f44682509cdfad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1973d3e032da00271281064bc1f6048c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91eaa109ea24a162611fa773620ba020&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9db3104624f7e905203fda44fdb17afc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d760073a0d234238e3fd1428b7c21581</data>
