<node id="Wix Payments">
  <data key="d0">Wix Payments</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Wix Payments is a payment service offered by Wix for secure online transactions.&lt;SEP&gt;Wix Payments is a payment provider that allows for direct payment acceptance and has its own payout management.&lt;SEP&gt;Wix Payments is a payment provider available on the Wix platform.&lt;SEP&gt;Wix Payments is a payment processing service that requires identity verification for account activation.&lt;SEP&gt;Wix Payments is a payment service provided by Wix, requiring account verification for its users.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7f49a209ebbbdf633aeb86649c74ccef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b261bd1be516879bb4cf4c614f85d257&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2500f2053a8609c7241fe3edad39c0a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91eaa109ea24a162611fa773620ba020&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9db3104624f7e905203fda44fdb17afc</data>
