  <data key="d2">PayPal is a payment service that can be used with Wix Stores for online transactions.&lt;SEP&gt;PayPal is a payment provider that allows businesses to accept payments online.&lt;SEP&gt;PayPal is a payment method available in Wix Bookings.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7f49a209ebbbdf633aeb86649c74ccef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b547442ea82aacb3fc7acd39a219545d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11fcbe4f87372db8aaaa4dc2b55ebe20</data>
