</node>
<node id="Datasets">
  <data key="d0">Datasets</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Datasets refer to collections of data that can be used to populate and update content on a website or other platform.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a35c395eb2de6194b0d0b819cc25645d</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1762778014</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Mirror On Site">
  <data key="d0">Mirror On Site</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Mirror on Site is a feature that allows the order of items in a collection view to be mirrored on a live website.&lt;SEP&gt;Mirror On Site is a feature that allows users to mirror the order of items in their collection view to their live site.&lt;SEP&gt;Mirror on site is a feature that allows users to mirror their collection's item order on their website.&lt;SEP&gt;Mirror On Site is a feature that allows users to mirror the item order of a collection on their live site.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a35c395eb2de6194b0d0b819cc25645d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4d8052bab145fa732f5fa1156e51a44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0953e715dad6f364462f8aebf53207a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-134de6c869a1bdf0a400dfea307efdce</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1762778671</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="FAQs">
  <data key="d0">FAQs</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">FAQs, or Frequently Asked Questions, are a type of content that provides answers to common questions about a topic or system.&lt;SEP&gt;FAQs refer to a section of frequently asked questions that provide answers to common queries about sorting, filtering, and mirroring live site content.&lt;SEP&gt;Frequently Asked Questions provide answers to common questions about managing CMS collection content.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a35c395eb2de6194b0d0b819cc25645d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4d8052bab145fa732f5fa1156e51a44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0953e715dad6f364462f8aebf53207a</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1762778671</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Collection">
  <data key="d0">Collection</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A collection is a grouping of items that can be controlled and managed.&lt;SEP&gt;A collection refers to a group of items or data that can be managed and organized within a CMS.&lt;SEP&gt;A collection is a group of items that can be managed and displayed on a site.&lt;SEP&gt;A collection consists of distinct fields and items, with each item's content stored in its fields.&lt;SEP&gt;A collection in the context of Wix's CMS refers to a group of related content items.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a35c395eb2de6194b0d0b819cc25645d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e0f039145f41fa401d0e8e33a185f71a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4d8052bab145fa732f5fa1156e51a44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0953e715dad6f364462f8aebf53207a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-134de6c869a1bdf0a400dfea307efdce</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1762778651</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Item">
  <data key="d0">Item</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">An item is an individual element or entry within a collection, which can have various fields and properties associated with it.&lt;SEP&gt;An item is a component of a collection, consisting of multiple fields and their values.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a35c395eb2de6194b0d0b819cc25645d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0953e715dad6f364462f8aebf53207a</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1762778671</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Field Values">
  <data key="d0">Field Values</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
